; ===========================================================================
; Opening Balances & Transfer-Account Closure (2026-08-17)
; ===========================================================================
; Bank accounts started mid-history (B3 data since 2019, bank data since
; mid-2025 / Dec-2025). The funding side of pre-tracking transfers was never
; imported, leaving large holes in Equity:Transfers:* and unanchored bank
; balances. Pads anchor each account to a known true balance:
;
;   - Bank accounts: asserted to today's real statement balances (2026-08-17).
;   - Equity:Transfers:*: asserted to zero at the bank-data boundary date, so
;     only genuine post-boundary pending transfers remain visible.
;
; The pad source account Equity:Opening-Balances represents pre-tracking net
; worth. Pads are recomputed at every load, so importing older bank data later
; automatically shrinks them instead of double-counting.

; --- Bank account anchors (asserted to real balances on 2026-08-17) ---

